      ],
      "justification": "Accurately represents the alternate pickup condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "items are counted and compared to the original contract"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of counting and comparing items."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Order is complete and all items were returned,\""
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional explicitly opens the branch point."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "we email the customer to inform them of the damage and additional charges"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of emailing the customer regarding damage and charges."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n20"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "if the \"Items are packed for an existing order,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the decision branch and perfectly matches the packing condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n25"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the \"Items are stored for future orders,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Perfectly matches the guard condition for storing items."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "missing items and replacement charges, we email the customer to inform them"
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the action of emailing the customer about missing items."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "we temporarily take them out of inventory"
      ],
      "justification": "Directly mirrors the action to remove damaged items from inventory."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n21"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Customer returns the missing items,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the decision split and the specific condition of returning missing items."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n26"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Customer does not return the missing items,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the alternate guard condition perfectly."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, when the process is complete, it ends."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps to the explicitly stated end action and terminal node."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are repaired and added into inventory,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Establishes the branching decision for item repair capability."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Items are repaired and added into inventory"
      ],
      "justification": "Perfect alignment with the repair and inventory addition action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Items can't be repaired and are discarded,\" we email the customer with replacement charges"
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately matches the discarding items and emailing action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b6->n22"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are packed for an existing order,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the branch and the specific packing condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b6->n27"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are stored for future orders,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Perfectly aligns with the condition for storing items."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once again, when the process is complete, it ends."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps to the explicitly stated end action and terminal node."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n23"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The customer is then emailed with replacement charges"
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the action of emailing replacement charges."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
